== start
TEST 8: Shop and travel. This NPC is a real Kweebec merchant.
-> Open the shop (expect this window to close and the barter shop to open in its place)
    <<shop>>
-> Teleport to the start of the corridor (expect to appear at the entrance; the window closes)
    <<teleport 0 1 0>>
-> Leave
    <<end>>
